一、源自 SLDataAPI 的部分 / Derived from SLDataAPI

MeSL 的语音链路沿用了 SLDataAPI（同一作者 DNT_OF，GPL-3.0-only）语音转发中经线上验证的实现与协议选择，
相关源文件保留了 SLDataAPI 的版权 / SPDX 头。
MeSL reuses proven voice-stream code and protocol choices from SLDataAPI (same author, DNT_OF,
GPL-3.0-only). Affected source files keep the SLDataAPI copyright/SPDX headers.

  SLDataAPI — Copyright (C) 2026 DNT_OF — https://github.com/DNTOF/SLDataAPI

  来源 / Origin                                   → MeSL
  Voice/VoiceService.cs  VoiceClient              → src/Mesh/PeerLink.cs
     主线程轮询、握手超时、Poll 写守卫 + 3 s 不可写判死、250 ms SendTimeout
     main-thread polling, handshake timeout, Poll write guard + 3 s unwritable drop, 250 ms SendTimeout
  Voice/VoiceService.cs  ProcessWsFrames/SendWsFrame/TryHandshake
                                                  → src/Core/WsFraming.cs
     帧长回绕检查（L-02）、超缓冲帧断连（N-01）、RFC 6455 握手
     length-wrap check (L-02), oversize-for-buffer disconnect (N-01), RFC 6455 handshake
  Voice/VoiceService.cs  TickOnce                 → src/Mesh/MeshLinkService.cs
     未握手 / 已鉴权分池、Accept 上限、心跳日志
     pending vs. authenticated pools, accept cap, heartbeat log
  Voice/VoiceService.cs  HandleIncoming/FnvHash   → src/Voice/VoiceCapture.cs, src/Core/Fnv.cs
     netId 为键、FNV-1a 内容去重、0.8 s 讲话段、说话者帧去重
     netId keys, FNV-1a content dedupe, 0.8 s burst detection, speaker-frame dedupe
  语音 WS 二进制帧 0x01 | channel | playerId | seq | payload
  voice WS binary frame                           → src/Core/MeshFrames.cs（VOICE 帧布局 / layout）
  Voice/VoiceRecorder.cs CleanField（X-01）       → src/Core/MeshFrames.cs MeshCodec.CleanField
  Control/ControlAuth.cs 失败锁定、SecureEquals   → src/Core/AuthLockout.cs
  Plugin.cs / Log.cs     事件链保护、配置自检、日志门面
                         event-chain guards, config integrity check, log facade
                                                  → src/Plugin.cs, src/Log.cs

MeSL 不解码语音（SLDataAPI 解码为 PCM 供 WebUI 收听），Opus 字节原样转发。
Unlike SLDataAPI (which decodes to PCM for its WebUI), MeSL forwards Opus bytes as-is.


二、MeSL 原创部分 / Original to MeSL

  MeSL-Protocol-v0（docs/MeSL-Protocol-v0.md）：HMAC 双向握手、HELLO 频道表、站点编码、
  一说话者一代理、隐身代理仅以对讲机经原版路径重注入、阵营分组接收过滤、雷达门。
  MeSL-Protocol-v0: mutual HMAC handshake, HELLO channel table, site encoding, per-speaker hidden
  proxy reinjected as radio only through the vanilla server voice path, faction-group receive
  filter, radio gate.


